text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2022-03-07/43010_1.jpg\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">もう<ruby>夏<rt>なつ</rt></ruby><ruby>頃<rt>ごろ</rt></ruby>には<ruby>分<rt>わ</rt></ruby>かっているのかな〜</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><ruby>一瞬<rt>いっしゅん</rt></ruby>ですね。わくわくどきどき。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">それでは！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">see you later</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Zapf Dingbats&quot;;\">✩</span><span class=\"s2\">.*˚#371</span></p></div></div>\n                    ",
